<title>JAPAN: Uny - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Uny - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 20, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	   336.31		vs	  308.52</p>
<p> Operating	    6.35		vs	    4.53</p>
<p> Current		5.80		vs	    3.32</p>
